1
00:00:00,506 --> 00:00:02,106
(Penny:)Uh-oh.
What?

2
00:00:02,108 --> 00:00:03,638
(Penny:)It's my boss.

3
00:00:03,643 --> 00:00:05,643
(Penny:)They moved my field ride
up to Monday.

4
00:00:05,645 --> 00:00:06,845
(Amy:)What does that mean?

5
00:00:06,846 --> 00:00:08,946
(Penny:)It means instead
of having a week to study,

6
00:00:08,948 --> 00:00:10,178
(Penny:)I only have two days.

7
00:00:10,183 --> 00:00:11,453
(Bernadette:)That sucks.

8
00:00:11,451 --> 00:00:13,021
(Amy:)Can you start
in the morning?

9
00:00:13,019 --> 00:00:14,189
(Penny:)Uh, it's kind of a lot.

10
00:00:14,187 --> 00:00:15,817
(Leonard:)You know,
let me do a little tonight,

11
00:00:15,822 --> 00:00:17,422
(Penny:)and I'll catch up
with you guys later.

12
00:00:17,423 --> 00:00:19,653
(Bernadette:)You sure?
Yeah, it's okay. Go ahead.

13
00:00:21,627 --> 00:00:23,627
(Amy:)So, um, now that
Penny's not coming...

14
00:00:23,629 --> 00:00:25,699
(Bernadette:)We're not seeing
Fairly Manilow.
Okay.

15
00:00:28,601 --> 00:00:30,671
(dramatic movie music
plays on TV)

16
00:00:33,339 --> 00:00:35,369
(Howard:)Hold on. Pause.

17
00:00:35,374 --> 00:00:37,404
(Howard:)Something doesn't make sense.
Look...

18
00:00:39,145 --> 00:00:41,745
(Howard:)In 2015, Biff steals
the sports almanac

19
00:00:41,748 --> 00:00:43,748
(Howard:)and takes the time machine

20
00:00:43,750 --> 00:00:47,620
(Howard:)back to 1955, to give it
to his younger self.

21
00:00:47,620 --> 00:00:50,790
(Howard:)But as soon as he does that,
he changes the future,

22
00:00:50,790 --> 00:00:53,120
(Howard:)so the 2015 he
returns to would be

23
00:00:53,126 --> 00:00:57,226
(Howard:)a different 2015, not the 2015
that Marty and Doc were in.

24
00:00:57,230 --> 00:01:03,020
This is Hot Tub Time Machine
all over again.

